NOTE TO MAINTAINER
================================================================================

This file currently contains only the SHORT NOTICE of LGPL-3.0-or-later.

For a fully compliant distribution, replace this file with:

  1. The full text of LGPL-3.0:
     https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.txt

  2. The full text of GPL-3.0 (referenced by LGPL-3.0):
     https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

Common practice:
  - LICENSE         → contains LGPL-3.0 full text
  - LICENSE.GPL     → contains GPL-3.0 full text (referenced by LGPL)
  - COPYING         → optional alias for LICENSE

Quick way to fetch them:

  curl -o LICENSE      https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.txt
  curl -o LICENSE.GPL  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

For per-file SPDX header (recommended for source files):

  // SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-or-later
  // Copyright (C) 2026 myCad contributors

See ADR-0001 (docs/adr/ADR-0001-license-lgpl-3.md) for the protocol decision rationale.
================================================================================
